    "title": "Trim a Binary Search Tree to a Given Range",
    "category": "Binary Search Trees",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "problemStatement": "Given the root of a Binary Search Tree and two values L and R, remove all nodes whose values lie outside the range [L, R] while preserving the Binary Search Tree property.",
